(2) log2 C(n, floor(n/2)) >= n - log2(n+1) holds for all 2 <= n <= 4096
(3) lower bound on L_F - L_xi - I(x:y) (up to an additive constant c):  log2 C(n, n/2) - len_delta(n)
    n = 2^3 : log2 C =         6.13   len_delta(n) =   8   gap >=        -1.87 - c
